diff --git a/src/Components/test/testassets/TestContentPackage/PersistentComponents/NonStreamingComponentWithDeclarativePersistentState.razor b/src/Components/test/testassets/TestContentPackage/PersistentComponents/NonStreamingComponentWithDeclarativePersistentState.razor
